'''Summer School''' is a [[Course]], available only in the [[Challenge Mode]] [[Campus]], [[Summer School (Challenge Mode)|Summer School]]. A [[Teacher]] with the [[Summer School Qualification]] will provide instruction to enrolled [[Students]] in the [[Lecture Theatre]].

==Requirements==
===[[File:Staff-Icon.png|32px]] Staff===
{{i2|Teachers|25px|alt=Teacher-Icon|br=no}} with the {{i2|Summer School Qualification|alt=Summer-School-Icon|br=no}} will be required to lead the [[Classes]] for this [[Course]], with the number required determined by the number of Students. The {{i2|Campus Requirements|25px|alt=Campus-Requirements-Icon|br=no}}, shown in the [[Interface#Campus View|Objectives Panel]] before the commencement of the [[Academic Year]], will indicate how many Teachers still need to be hired to fill every class on the [[Timetable]] (if any).

When starting the Course, Teachers may be hired at or trained to {{i2|Qualification Level|25px|alt=Qualification-Level-Icon|br=no}} 3. This cap may be raised as far as {{i2|Qualification Level|25px|alt=Qualification-Level-Icon|br=no}} 10 by upgrading the [[Course Level]]. Not every Course Level upgrade raises the maximum Qualification Level; please see [[Summer School Qualification|Staff Training]] for details.<noinclude>
